====Verb====
{{en-verb}}

# {{lb|en|impersonal|meteorology}} To have rain fall from the sky.
#: {{ux|en|Judging by the black cloud, it will '''rain''' later today.}}
#* {{RQ:Shakespeare Twelfth Night|V|i|passage=The rain it '''raineth''' every day.}}
# {{lb|en|intransitive|figuratively}} To fall as or like rain.
#: {{ux|en|Tears '''rained''' from her eyes.}}
